<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica money mkt shortage back below 9.0 bln rand.</title>
<headline>SAfrica money mkt shortage back below 9.0 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage dipped backed below nine billion at the weekend, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>The shortage stood at 8.956 billion rand on Saturday from 9.002 billion on Friday, after registering 9.65 billion rand on Thursday.</p>
</text>
